        "name": "Lockout Error Code",
        "why": "Lockout error code"
      },
      {
        "ref": "BI 1",
        "name": "Com Status",
        "why": "Modbus link between ProtoAir and the LMV52"
      }
    ],
    "enable": "BV 8 Control Mode and AV 9 Operating Mode select how the LMV52 takes its demand; the manual does not list their values.",
    "heartbeat": null,
    "remote_sensors": null,
    "setup": [
      "Device instance = Node_Offset (default 50,000) + the controller's Node-ID (1-255), so Node-ID 1 gives 50001.",
      "ProtoAir default IP address is 192.168.1.24, mask 255.255.255.0.",
      "Add each controller as a profile in the ProtoAir Web Configurator and give it a unique Node-ID.",
      "Wiring to the LMV52 follows the instructions supplied with the boiler and control (manual note 2)."
    ],
    "gotchas": [
      "No state texts are printed for Control Mode or Operating Mode; check the Siemens LMV5 Modbus documentation before writing them."
    ]
  },
